---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro"
Astro.response.status = 403
---

<Base title="仅限社员 · NBTCA">
  <main>
    <h1>这里只对社员开放</h1>
    <p class="muted">你已经登录，但这个账号的邮箱不在社员名单里。如果你是社员，请把登录用的邮箱发给管理员登记。</p>
    <p><a class="button ghost" href="/logout">换个账号登录</a></p>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  main {
    max-width: 32rem;
    margin: 18vh auto;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
</style>
